-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_developmental-investment-fund-act-2000.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- developmental purpose and financial year`

#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `expanding an industry that will create jobs in Singapore`
#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `expanding a business with good export market prospects`
