#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `building a hospital for the general welfare of Singapore`
#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `reclaiming land in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `reclaiming land abroad`
#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `commercialising a new technology`
#ASSERT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `a feasibility survey for a land reclamation in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `a feasibility survey for a land reclamation abroad`
#ASSERT NOT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `supporting the general budget`
#ASSERT NOT `the aim is a developmental purpose` `earning a financial return only`

#ASSERT `the financial year ends on 31 March of` 3 2026 EQUALS 2026
#ASSERT `the financial year ends on 31 March of` 4 2026 EQUALS 2027
#ASSERT `the financial year ends on 31 March of` 12 2026 EQUALS 2027

