§ `s 4 -- application of moneys`

#ASSERT `the moneys may be applied` `subscribing for shares in a company` `commercialising a new technology`
#ASSERT NOT `the moneys may be applied` `subscribing for shares in a company` `earning a financial return only`
#ASSERT `the moneys may be applied` `forming a company` `expanding a business with good export market prospects`
#ASSERT `the moneys may be applied` `investing in an overseas fund` `commercialising a new technology`
#ASSERT NOT `the moneys may be applied` `buying property` `reclaiming land abroad`
