#ASSERT NOT `the moneys may be applied` `paying brokerage on an investment` `earning a financial return only`
#ASSERT `the moneys may be applied` `paying the Fund's administration expenses` `earning a financial return only`
#ASSERT NOT `the moneys may be applied` `making an outright grant to a business` `commercialising a new technology`
#ASSERT NOT `the moneys may be applied` `paying a ministry's running costs` `supporting the general budget`

#ASSERT NOT `section 7(3) of the Financial Procedure Act applies` `subscribing for shares in a company`
#ASSERT `section 7(3) of the Financial Procedure Act applies` `paying brokerage on an investment`
#ASSERT `section 7(3) of the Financial Procedure Act applies` `paying the Fund's administration expenses`

§ `ss 5, 6(1) and 9 -- control and authorisation`

#ASSERT `who has day-to-day control` TRUE EQUALS `the responsible Minister for the account`
